The DOWJONES command gives you immediate access to Dow Jones news/
Retrieval.  Dow Jones offers more than 20 different services, including
current stock quotes and the latest business news from The Wall Street
Journal, Barron's and the Dow Jones News Service or ticker.
 
Other services range from movie reviews, the full 20-volume Academic
American Encyclopedia, and a discount shopping service to sports, weather
and a constantly updated world news report.
 
To use Dow Jones News/Retrieval, type DOWJONES and then follow the
instructions below.  To return from Dow Jones to MCI Mail, type DISC.
 
-- Just as you do when using MCI Mail, press RETURN after typing any
command on Dow Jones.
 
-- When in doubt, press RETURN for more (Dow Jones pauses after each
'screenful' of information in some data bases).
 
When you first access Dow Jones from MCI Mail, you will see a brief
 
